From: Okty <okty111-ux@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:44:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] SolarEdge cloud: optimizer data and site production from the
 monitoring portal

- logs in to the SolarEdge One portal like the browser (OAuth 2 + PKCE on
  login.solaredge.com, refresh token kept in LittleFS)
- every 15 min: site layout, live U/I/P per optimizer, today's energy and
  temperature per optimizer, production today / month / year / lifetime
- page /fusion/secloud (menu: Chmura SolarEdge) with settings and an
  optimizer table; the password is never sent back to the browser
- SolarEdge.getData() falls back to the cloud values when Modbus has no data,
  so dashboard, charts, history and Tuya keep working

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EySGZ7zzCqzbQeGccwYzek
